OL,3,GNEWSAConsultation opens on first 'quiet
OL,4,Alane' trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FA public consultation on Oxfordshire's
OL,7,Ffirst "quiet lane" trial has been
OL,8,Fopened "for at least six months".
OL,10,FA gate has been installed at the
OL,11,FBayswater Road end of Shepherd's Pit
OL,12,FLane in Stanton St John, just outside
OL,13,FOxford, aiming to create "safer and
OL,14,Fmore attractive routes for people
OL,15,Fwalking, wheeling, cycling and horse
OL,16,Friding, by reducing the impact of motor
OL,17,Ftraffic," said the county council.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
