OL,3,GNEWSAConsultation opens on first 'quiet
OL,4,Alane' trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccess is maintained for residents,
OL,7,Ffarmers, landowners, businesses and
OL,8,Femergency services, with other
OL,9,Fthrough-traffic routed along the B4027
OL,10,FWheatley Road and Bayswater Road.
OL,12,FThe council's transport boss Gareth
OL,13,FEpps called it "an opportunity to see
OL,14,Fhow a 'fully filtered' quiet lane works
OL,15,Fin practice".
